      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-06T23:52:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m curious, should we be exposing all this information to _all_ clients? Or just some? What is this used for?\n\nIf this is for bugreports, could you consider moving this to be DUMP_TRANSACTION w/ associated standard permission check?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 23,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "b8f1e9608fa330e3f466ef0d6459d03b6d4de676",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
