      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T20:40:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See dump function in frameworks/native/libs/binder/rust/src/proxy.rs. The benefit is that it would automatically get dumped in bugreports.\n\nUID 0 + shell is more than good enough, great. For dump, there is a CTS test which checks that permissions are set correctly for services visible to apps.",
      "parentUuid": "b16c0399_764102b0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 23,
        "startChar": 0,
