      "author": {
        "id": 1380243
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T11:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When would we join on the thread? The main thread joins on the Binder thread pool, so should only exit if it crashes, in which case we can\u0027t callback clients anyway, but they will get death notifications.",
      "parentUuid": "4689623c_115700b9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 86,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "b8f1e9608fa330e3f466ef0d6459d03b6d4de676",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
